cek_value.bin, cmk_private.pem, cmk_cert.pem and cell_value.bin are the test
fixtures cekv.key, always-encrypted.pem, always-encrypted_pub.pem and
column_value.enc of github.com/swisscom/mssql-always-encrypted (vendored in
github.com/microsoft/go-mssqldb v1.11.2), renamed. They are a throwaway test
certificate, a column encryption key value SQL Server stored under it, and one
cell value encrypted with that key. Their license:

